        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn wi̱ni cukɛ ben kä Ɛ̈n-ti-ɔk kɛ riey, guäth ëë ca kɛ ka̱m puɔ̱th baaŋ Kuɔth kɛ kui̱ la̱t in ci kɛn ɛ thuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
